<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan FGEP group to tender 54,000 tonnes US corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan FGEP group to tender 54,000 tonnes US corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's FGEP corn-buying group will tender on Friday for one 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. No.2 corn, local traders said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The FGEP group comprises Fwu Sow Grain, Great Wall Enterprise, President Enterprise, Ever Smile Feed Mill Co and group newcomer Taiwan Fong Yu.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p>			     U.S. Gulf	   Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>    One	54,000    March 10-25	 March 26-April 9</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
